        <item8>
          <explanatoryNotes>After a detailed review, it was determined that the Form 24F-2 registration fee for the Schwab Annuity Portfolios ("the Trust") was calculated incorrectly for the Fiscal Year periods ending December 31, 2019 to December 31, 2024. Specifically, sales of shares of the Schwab S&P 500 Index Portfolio, a series of the Trust, to certain unregistered insurance company separate accounts were inadvertently not included in the annual Form 24F-2 registration fee calculations during that period. This amended 24F-2 resulted in a Redemption credit available for use in future years, and, therefore, no payment will be made in this filing.

</explanatoryNotes>
